{"seq":4,"slug":"git-workflow-in-practice","title":"Git Workflow In Practice","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-git-workflow/git-workflow-in-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"conventions-and-automation","title":"约定与自动化","url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-git-workflow/git-workflow-in-practice/conventions-and-automation","wordCount":2042,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"agents-committing-safely","title":"让 Agent 安全地提交","url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-git-workflow/git-workflow-in-practice/agents-committing-safely","wordCount":1754,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"recovering-and-clean-history","title":"恢复与保持历史整洁","url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-git-workflow/git-workflow-in-practice/recovering-and-clean-history","wordCount":1805,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲 git 工作流落到实处的几件事:约定与自动化——用 commit 规范、git hooks、CI 把工作流的纪律(格式、检查、信息规范)自动化,让人和 agent 都照着走;让 agent 安全地提交——给 agent 清楚的提交约定与边界(别 add 不该 add 的、别提交密钥、签名怎么处理),让它的提交规范且安全;以及恢复与保持历史整洁——出错时怎么用 git 安全地恢复(revert/reset/回滚)、以及怎么让提交历史保持清晰可读而非一团乱。\n"}